    "KIMI_CODE_AGENT_SWARM_MAX_CONCURRENCY` to a positive integer to cap how many subagents run at the same time during that ramp, or leave it unset for no cap. If it is set to a value that is not a positive integer, the AgentSwarm call fails fast.",
